---
// packages/web/src/components/ECash.astro
---

<section class="py-24 bg-snow-50">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8">
      Built for eCash.com by Paul Sztorc
    </h2>
    <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Drivechain (BIP 300/301) has long promised purpose-built sidechains secured by proof-of-work.
      The upcoming eCash hard-fork activates Drivechains on an eCash base layer, providing a
      new specification for an e-cash system that preserves privacy and scalability. However,
      EthSide — the original EVM sidechain — was retired because standalone chain management was too
      time‑consuming.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Snowside fills that gap. We have coordinated with the eCash community to ensure the L1's
      configuration meets the specification. By leveraging Avalanche and operational automation, we
      give the community a chain that they can <strong class="text-snow-600">actually use</strong> –
      without babysitting.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 text-sm">
      <a href="https://drivechain.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-4 py-2 bg-surface-1 border border-white/10 text-slate-200 hover:border-white/30 hover:text-white transition">
        drivechain.info
      </a>
      <a href="https://drivechains.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-4 py-2 bg-surface-1 border border-white/10 text-slate-200 hover:border-white/30 hover:text-white transition">
        drivechains.org
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/LayerTwo-Labs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-4 py-2 bg-surface-1 border border-white/10 text-slate-200 hover:border-white/30 hover:text-white transition">
        LayerTwo Labs (GitHub)
      </a>
      <a href="https://x.com/Truthcoin" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-4 py-2 bg-surface-1 border border-white/10 text-slate-200 hover:border-white/30 hover:text-white transition">
        Paul Sztorc on X
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
